steps:
The timeline gives hours with something in them full height; empty hours fold to a thin band. Left column: places, as visits with their times. The right column holds:
    - sleep, as a normal surface card with a stripe of its stages (NOT the black block);
    - the weigh-in;
    - meals, as data-energy marks with time, name and kcal range;
    - the workout, with template name and working sets.
